hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2877","###\n Ali bin Khushram narrated to us, saying: 'Isa narrated to us, from Ibn Jurayj. And also, Muhammad bin Ma'mar narrated to us, saying: Muhammad narrated to us, saying: Ibn Jurayj informed us, saying: Abu az-Zubayr informed me that he heard Jabir bin Abdullah (RA) say: \I saw the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) throwing the pebbles (at the Jamaraat) while he was riding on his mount on the Day of Nahr"""
